# UX workflow: first-frame Base/Modulation projection across navigation.
# Purpose: proves cold entry, page change, and Track change each render their
# own resolved tuple without a second navigation gesture used as refresh.
# Expect: capture_changed:cold_projection=page_2_projection, capture_changed:page_2_projection=track_2_projection, capture_match:track_2_projection=macro_reentered

0 scenario macro-initial-projection
300 capture screen cold_projection

# Page is the canonical hot focus. Preview then commit Page 2; its first frame
# must already show the distinct Base plus modulation rail.
440 encoder NAV 1
580 tap NAV 60
800 capture screen page_2_projection

# Track is reachable only through Structure. Select Track 2, descend to Page,
# apply the context, and verify its first hot frame without a refresh gesture.
940 button NAV down
2010 tick
2070 button NAV up
2210 encoder NAV 1
2350 tap NAV 60
2490 tap NAV 60
2730 capture screen track_2_projection

# Leave Macro for Project, then return through the same global selector. View
# entry must reuse/publish the coherent Track 2 tuple, not repaint Out as Base.
2870 button LEFT_TOP down
2990 encoder NAV 1
3110 encoder NAV 1
3230 button LEFT_TOP up
3450 capture screen project_view

3590 button LEFT_TOP down
3710 encoder NAV -1
3830 encoder NAV -1
3950 button LEFT_TOP up
4230 capture screen macro_reentered
